        <mxCell id="card-legend" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;How to read&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Green&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: where the apps run, or a service of the platform.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Violet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: where the data is kept.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Cyan&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: what people open (Grafana, the CMP portal).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Grey&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: outside the platform, or a tool.&lt;br&gt;• Arrows point from who asks to who answers.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="820" width="760" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-read" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#059669&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;In short&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• Every cluster runs Alloy. AWS and GCP send through the WireGuard tunnels to the on-prem stores.&lt;br&gt;• Each project sees only its own metrics and logs in Grafana and in the CMP.&lt;br&gt;• Alerts go to Discord, from Grafana, the alert rules and the CMP. Costs are read from the same metrics (OpenCost, on-prem today).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="820" width="1020" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
